  "description": "PDF viewing for TKCode.Arc: PdfViewer (PageViewer plus a sidebar with thumbnails and outline, search, text selection, links and the states of opening a document, password included) and Pdf.Source for a plain PageViewer, over a pluggable backend (IPdfBackend). Without a backend a real document reports that none is set up; SimulatedPdfDocument serves tests and design time. Backends ship separately: TKCode.Arc.Pdf.Native (PDFium) and TKCode.Arc.Pdf.Browser (pdf.js).",
